ID: vr-03
Title: Define Verona's first useful outcome
GitHub issue: https://github.com/Zanark/Verona/issues/3

Status: DONE
Milestone: Owner-grounded product brief and first vertical-slice acceptance.
Dependencies: None

Purpose:
Turn the received idea into a bounded original application, not assumptions
inherited from KardboardCode. Initial idea is received; technology/acceptance
choices depend on the explicitly requested research before implementation.

Tasks:
[x] Read the owner's initial idea and reconcile docs/product-brief.md.
[x] Establish audience, inputs/outputs, platform, privacy and non-goals.
[x] Decide whether face mesh is needed and what behavior would justify reuse.
[x] Compare appropriate minimal stacks using actual constraints.
[x] Define a first end-to-end slice, acceptance checks and dependent workstreams.

Acceptance criteria:
Brief faithfully records owner intent and clearly labels remaining proposals.
First useful behavior, failures, exclusions and verification path are concrete.
Stack and any tracking reuse follow requirements rather than precede them.

Completion evidence:
docs/product-brief.md defines the owner's Windows text-first evaluation slice,
inputs/outputs, local CPU/installed English TTS/WebGL2 stack, privacy/resource
bounds, explicit failures, acceptance checks and non-goals. Chapters 04-06
separate research, CPU evidence and functional speaking-face qualification.
vr-06 and vr-07 implement dependent finite slices. Closing product definition
does not claim human acceptance, phonetic accuracy or assistant implementation.

Completion log:
2026-11-18 - Owner explicitly said the full idea will follow project preparation.
No implementation started; BLOCKED is an input dependency, not an app failure.
2026-11-18 - Owner supplied the idea: recorded speech -> synchronized animated
wireframe face with articulation/expressions; future voiced conversational
assistant. Research first, accuracy over appearance. Missing-idea blocker lifted.
2026-11-18 - Research synthesis proposes offline native-geometry playback before
streaming/retargeting. Available compute/service/license route still needs an
owner choice; this product-definition workstream remains IN_PROGRESS.
2026-11-18 - Owner chose free/local AMD. vr-06 demonstrates numerical CPU
inference/PCA, not yet a complete speaking-face slice or acceptance.
2026-11-18 - Overnight text-first authority and actual implementation resolve
the first-slice choices. Brief reconciled; definition complete. Perceptual
